        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-05T17:23:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I went with a variant of Mister Fixer.  Jeans, steel toe boots, white t-shirt (didn’t have time to get a Gi), blue RC hat, white belt, and masking tape wrapped around both hands.  My “date” went as Wonder Woman (the variant who wears black pants).  Other people include No Face (or something like that), Major Hues in civilian clothes, standard Japanese female school uniform, a bunny dragon, the guy from Castlevania, a duck, a white belt karate, and Victorique de Blois.</p>",
